{
  "id": "mole_and_the_avagadro_s_number",
  "title": "Mole and Avogadro's Number",
  "description": "Calculate the number of molecules or moles using Avogadro's number. The mole is the SI base unit for amount of substance, with Avogadro's constant (NA) = 6.022141×10^23 molecules/mol.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Parameter",
        "Value",
        "Unit"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Avogadro's Number (NA)",
          "6.022141×10^23",
          "molecules/mol"
        ],
        [
          "Standard Molar Volume (STP)",
          "22.414",
          "liters/mol"
        ],
        [
          "Temperature (STP)",
          "0",
          "°C"
        ],
        [
          "Pressure (STP)",
          "1",
          "atm"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "mass",
          "label": "Mass of Substance",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "molecular_weight",
          "label": "Molecular Weight",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/kmol",
          "defaultValue": 46.07
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "number_of_moles",
          "label": "Number of Moles",
          "formula": "inputs.mass / inputs.molecular_weight * 1000",
          "unit": "mol"
        },
        {
          "id": "number_of_molecules",
          "label": "Number of Molecules",
          "formula": "(inputs.mass / inputs.molecular_weight) * 6.022141e23 * 1000",
          "unit": "molecules",
          "format": "scientific"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Information\n\n**Avogadro's Constant (NA)**: 6.022141×10^23 molecules/mol\n\n**Standard Molar Volume**: 22.414 liters/mol at STP (1 atm, 0°C)\n\n### Formula for Number of Molecules:\nn = (mass / molecular_weight) × NA × 1000\n\nWhere:\n- mass is in kg\n- molecular_weight is in kg/kmol\n- NA is Avogadro's number"
    }
  ]
}